  "Description":      "Speaking Avatar Formation: forms the Speaking Avatar of the input Avatar Model, animated as it utters the Speech. Generative Face Description and Generative Body Description make the Face and Body Descriptors from the Speech and the Text, expressive when a Face or Body Personal Status is supplied; Speaking Avatar Synthesis packages the Avatar, the Speech and the Descriptors. The Avatar is kept by Speaking Avatar Synthesis: given once, it is used for every utterance until another arrives.",

